abstract: >-
  A bf16 LoRA fine-tune of Qwen/Qwen3.5-4B for tool / function calling,
  trained on Salesforce/xlam-function-calling-60k via Unsloth + TRL.
  Published as v1.0 below the project's +3pp BFCL gate (delta -8.3pp on
  the in-tree V3 single-turn evaluator) with full per-category disclosure
  of the must_not_call regression.
